-- Naive 365 n days with no pairing would give these, which the text does not: not asserted equal to the module's answer.
-- (see tests-red.l4)
-- Purposive reading of the leap-day pair (fork F-pair): the preceding day may be the excluded first day.
#ASSERT `on the purposive reading of the leap-day pair, before the rest-day rule, the last day of` 2 `years counted from` (YMD 2024 2 28) EQUALS (YMD 2026 2 28)
