-- Consecutive holidays: the two readings differ.  Saturday 14 March 2026 under 'Saturdays, Sundays and Monday 16 March 2026':
--   run-extending: Tuesday 17 March; one step only: Sunday 15 March, which is itself a holiday.
#ASSERT `extended to the next day that is not a holiday` `Saturdays, Sundays and Monday 16 March 2026` (YMD 2026 3 14) EQUALS (YMD 2026 3 17)
